  "goodToKnow": "Der Niedergang is decline or downfall: der Niedergang des Bergbaus, der wirtschaftliche Niedergang. Oswald Spengler's 1918 book Der Untergang des Abendlandes (The Decline of the West) uses the stronger word der Untergang (demise, sinking, as of the Titanic). The opposite is der Aufstieg (rise). Nieder means down: niederlegen, Niederlage (defeat). It has no plural."
